  "details": "VRC Version: 1281\n\nWhen the message \"Cant travel.. You are not allowed to travel to that location. (Code:403)\" appears, you are given 1 option (okay) that you have to press to return back to the menu. However, if you press \"esc\" instead of \"Okay\" the main menu will close, but the \"cant travel\" message will remain on the screen, blocking your avatar movement. It will also lock the mouse movement and not allow you to move the mouse to press \"okay\" on the message. \n\nYou can still jump, crouch, and sit, but the \"cant travel\" menu will remain active along with mouse movement being locked. The only way to press \"Okay\" is to press TAB.\n\nVideo Demonstration: https://streamable.com/yrkk38",
